Package: tidylens
Title: Classical Film-Frame Analysis in R
Version: 3.3.0
Author: Nabeel Siddiqui [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Nabeel Siddiqui <nabeel@example.com>
Description: A tidy, pipeable toolkit for classical film-frame analysis in R.
    Provides functions for extracting frames and shots from video files,
    computing inspectable visual features and vector representations, and
    classifying shot scale. All analysis runs locally without CNNs, cloud
    APIs, opaque model services, or Python workflows.
